    "scenario": "A 4-year-old girl presents with a several-day history of decreased activity and poor oral intake associated with upper respiratory symptoms. She now has an acute onset of wheezing. The frontal and lateral views of her chest radiograph are shown below. Which of the following is her most likely underlying cardiac diagnosis?",
